WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.570
Zombies...

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:09.940
Those who have died, and are brought back by curses and potions...

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.230
Said to roam in search of human flesh...

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.490
Terrifying monsters.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.010
Within a quaint rural Japanese town...

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.380
...lived one such zombie.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:51.220
Oh, it's just Babu-chan.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.940
You startled me...

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.450
I am also a zombie.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.440
Hm?

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.450
What is the matter?

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:04.280
I'm no longer alive.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.990
Here, I will wash you, too.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.350
Let us take your bandages off.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:50.350
Due to accidents, both her and I died young,

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:55.860
and became zombies after using a potion.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:00.110
The one who made such a wonderful potion,

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:03.330
is my master, Furuya Chihiro.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.620
Hey, Babu, I'm home.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:10.620
Since he has always been fond of zombie movies and games,

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:13.440
he eventually concocted a zombie potion.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:19.380
I got some dry ice to cool you down.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:23.010
Welcome home, Furuya-kun.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:26.240
You're a zombie, so why are you taking showers?

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:31.820
Even zombies need to take showers to be clean.

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:33.020
Right?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:37.780
To be honest, I wouldn't mind skipping them...

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:01.740
If I could, I would like to open my
stomach so I can clean my insides too.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.190
Forget it.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:06.300
You're stitched together so your intestines don't spill out.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:07.810
There.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.620
Here're your Hydrangea leaves, Babu.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:23.070
I was initially this house's pet cat.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.650
She left her home after becoming a zombie,

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.750
and has been staying here ever since.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.580
The weather is so nice.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:39.360
Rather than being treated like someone special,

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:43.870
she has always longed to live like an ordinary girl.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.930
Hey, Furuya-kun.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.930
Let us go for a walk before dinner.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:56.310
Listen here, you're dead, remember?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:01.770
When organisms die, do you know what happens to their bodies?

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:08.320
Um, the proteins disperse, and amino acids increase...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.980
Oh, and the umami-taste composition also increases, right?

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.080
You're right, but that's not what I'm getting at.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:20.790
Remember when you died and your body stopped moving?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.840
That's called rigor mortis.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.840
It happens to all animals.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.250
Oh!

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.260
It's like making sashimi from fresh dead fish!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.710
It gets all stiff!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:34.100
Why are your metaphors all food-related?

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:39.610
Once rigor mortis stops, the body gradually...

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:47.990
Anyway, just don't go outside too much when the sun is out!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.110
Okay.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.940
While understanding how she feels,

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:58.120
my master must also preserve her zombie body.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:01.630
Well, a little bit won't hurt...

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:13.190
My master has clearly become more
dependable than he was when I was still alive.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.730
The weather is nice today, too.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.050
What're you doing?!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:34.620
I'm sorry.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.980
Geez... I know you're happy about being able to go to school,

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.360
but don't forget about your body.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.380
Okay.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.090
It's not too bright out, so it's probably fine...

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.670
Well, we're here.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:52.890
Yep.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:54.640
See ya.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.920
Seriously, stay out of direct sunlight.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.980
Also, don't forget to eat the hydrangea leaves.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.340
Got it.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:07.650
Constantly eating hydrangea leaves is
important for preserving a dead body, right?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.150
Y-Yeah.

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:14.160
Well, I'll see you later, Furuya-kun!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.100
Crap, they're already here?

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.200
Wanko!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.600
You aren't planning on transferring to Sanka High, are you?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.510
Like hell!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:40.060
I just walked Rea over here.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.850
I see.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.980
You know, I've got practice early in the morning...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.960
Why don'tcha escort me, too?

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:48.560
I'm a frail girl and all...

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:51.070
Frail, my ass...

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:54.660
You did not just say that...!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:01.090
Good morning, Matsukida-san, Onozawa-san.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.080
Good morning, Sanka-san.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.960
Good morning, Sanka-san.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.090
Good morning, Kusakabe-san.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.970
Hey, Rea-sama!

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:15.720
Good morning, you finally came to school?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.470
Oh, Heren-chan, good morning.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:20.930
Morning practice?

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:21.770
Yes.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:28.090
I was worried since I'm not really a morning person, but I'm getting by.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.230
I see; keep up the good work.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.120
Geez, I'm sweating from practice.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:37.120
See you in class, Rea-sama!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.790
Oh, wait!

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:48.500
Oh?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.460
Sanka-san?

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.090
Good morning.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.350
Sensei!

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.890
Good morning.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:56.620
Looks like you're all better now.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.900
Huh?

00:08:57.900 --> 00:09:01.570
It looked like you were holding something in recently.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.850
I was a little worried.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:07.430
O-Oh, I see.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:12.070
Might there be a boy you like now?

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.030
What?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.530
I was just teasing.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:27.290
U-Um, this ball seems to have been old...

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.190
I'll see you later!

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:43.270
The human brain is said to limit muscle activity to about 20-30% of it's maximum capacity.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:49.450
However, zombies do not have such a limiter,

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:52.030
so they can constantly exert their full power.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.240
Who knew Rea-sama could jump so high?!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.270
And she hasn't even broke a sweat!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:13.750
Rea'd better not be exerting herself too much...

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.300
A normal girl, huh...?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.510
What're you muttering on about?

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:22.480
Something on your mind for once?

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:26.020
I've got loads of problems, unlike someone else I know.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.790
Furuya-kun seems different these days, doesn't he?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.450
He seems more mature, somehow.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.470
Huh?!

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:37.030
He's clearly still Mr. Zombie-fetish!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.200
Hey Yasutaka,

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:43.280
do you know where a normal girl would like to go on a date?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.750
Huh?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.290
I just thought you might know.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:53.040
Furuya-kun's interested in normal girls?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.220
What's with you?

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.940
So, which girl are we talkin' about here?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:04.560
Don't tell me you're planning a date with Rea-san!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.260
Or is it Wanko-san?

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.570
Or is it your sister Mero-chan?

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.610
I won't approve of that!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.790
I'm telling you it isn't like that!

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:16.190
I wonder who Furuya-kun is going out with...

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:24.950
Indeed, the human world is quite a confusing place.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:29.450
In contrast, we cats are quite a laid back kind.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:47.810
Oh, I thought that I ran you over!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.560
Ah, there there.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.820
Hey, listen!

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:10.160
During today's basketball game I made a "bunk slam", wait no...

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.970
Maybe it was called a "spam junk"...?

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:14.330
You mean a slam dunk, right?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:15.670
Yes, that!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.650
I made one today!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.840
Zombie powers are great!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:22.550
W-Wait, you did PE?!

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:28.650
You just can't feel it, but that puts lots of strain on your muscles!

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:30.100
Be careful!

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.310
Oh, okay...

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:35.690
I'll keep it in moderation from now on.

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.070
Sheesh, do you really understand...?

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.650
It's getting cloudy.

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.970
Sitting here seems like a waste.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.970
There's not much we can do about it...

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.790
That is not true.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:06.440
The clouds block out the sun, so it is nice and cool now.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.380
It is the perfect weather for a stroll!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.680
W-Wait!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.970
It's perfectly fine.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.140
Zombies cannot catch colds, right?

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:20.320
I'm keeping it in moderation.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:23.320
Make sure you don't trip over anything!

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:26.650
As a zombie,

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:31.110
she's finally been able to live the life of an ordinary girl.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:48.410
There is nothing stopping me from touching snails now.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.950
When I was alive,

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:54.350
my parents forbade me from touching any kind of creature.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.980
Normal girls all do this kind of stuff, right?

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.990
After seeing this, my master's feelings...

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.740
...must have been beyond imagination.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.480
I'm sorry.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.230
For making you accompany me when you're sleepy.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.530
Well, I should be apologising.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.890
Taking walks with you is all I can do.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:16.250
In that case, how about you hang out with me at school?

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:21.500
You could pose as a student at my school and blend in!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.170
What, you mean dress up as a girl?

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.630
Who knows, maybe it will suit you.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:30.510
How am I supposed to reply to something like that?

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:35.910
Oh yeah, back when I was alive,

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:39.890
we would always meet on nights like this.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.640
Yeah...

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.650
How beautiful!

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:56.150
We can see the entire city from up here!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.910
Hey, make sure you don't fall, all right?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.430
It's all right.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:07.170
Since I am a zombie, it will not hurt even if I do.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.030
That's not the point!

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:14.110
It's <i>because</i> you're a zombie, if you get hurt...

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.050
I know.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:19.300
I would not heal, would I?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.810
No matter how long I wait.

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:23.310
Rea...

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:26.270
The wound on my stomach is sewn shut,

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.560
but will never come together.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.570
That is why, I want to cherish it...

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:38.320
This time we have together, what we have not done yet...

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:44.490
The cells within those that have died stop regenerating.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:54.840
Normally, living things stay alive by producing new cells and doing away with old cells.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:02.760
But zombies, while being kept active through that potion,

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.020
will not produce anything new.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:12.020
This means,

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:16.700
while they feel no pain,

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.020
they are,

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.530
slowly yet surely,

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.280
rotting away...

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.410
Wait!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.370
Slow down a bit!

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.790
Woah!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.760
Thank you.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.710
No problem.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.970
Please be careful.

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:42.140
It'd be really bad if you got hurt.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.060
Sheesh...

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.690
The body wastes away,

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.190
and also slowly...

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.360
Slowly....

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.660
Babu-chan!

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.890
Welcome back.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.380
I'm putting dry ice in your bed for you.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.970
What's the matter?

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.280
You're feeling sweet today...

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:10.730
Oh, you...

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.630
Babu-chan!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:21.990
I'll be going now!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:27.370
Make sure you stay in the shade during the day!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:32.870
Whether alive or otherwise, the world is not a cosy place.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.380
I don't know what awaits those two,

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:42.170
but I will also enjoy the time that I have left before my body is laid to waste.

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:09.790
We are looking forward to see you on board again.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:15.290
We will be landing at Narita Airport shortly.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.660
"Confused Period"...

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:26.780
Two weeks after their death,

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:33.480
all zombies lose the distinction between sense, and instinct,

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.270
and devour their loved ones out of affection.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.060
This is called the "Confused Period".

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:47.070
Dr. Boyle, I wonder what sort of samples await me in Japan...?
